<header class="chat-heading">
<div><h1>Chat</h1><p id="chat-model-label" class="muted"><%= models[1] or "No models available" %></p></div>
<div class="chat-heading-actions"><button id="chat-settings-open" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="chat-settings-dialog" aria-expanded="false" hidden>Settings</button><button id="chat-reset" type="button">New chat</button></div>
</header>
<div class="chat-frame">
<section class="chat-conversation" aria-label="Conversation">
<div id="chat-messages" class="chat-messages" role="log" aria-label="Messages" aria-live="off">
<% if #models == 0 then %>
<div class="notice">No Chat Completions models are available to you yet. Models served only through the native Responses protocol cannot be used in this web chat.</div>
<% else %>
<div id="chat-empty" class="chat-empty"><span class="eyebrow">Your workspace</span><h2>More room to think.</h2><p>Ask a question or describe a task.<br>Choose a model and tune the session in Settings.</p></div>
<% end %>
</div>
<div class="chat-compose-area">
<p id="chat-error" class="error" role="alert"></p>
<div class="chat-composer">
<textarea id="chat-input" rows="2" aria-label="Message" placeholder="Ask a question or describe a task…"<% if #models == 0 then %> disabled<% end %>></textarea>
<div class="chat-composer-actions"><span class="muted">Enter to send · Shift+Enter for a new line</span><button id="chat-send" type="button"<% if #models == 0 then %> disabled<% end %>>Send</button></div>
</div>
<p id="chat-status" class="chat-status muted" role="status"></p>
<details class="chat-help"><summary>Privacy, metrics &amp; limits</summary><p>Timing and tokens/s are browser-observed, including network/relay latency; tokens are provider-reported when available. GLM and compatible models only. Conversations and settings are browser-local; the server also retains the last ten inference requests and replies per account, visible to you and administrators.</p></details>
</div>
</section>
<aside class="chat-settings" id="chat-settings" aria-labelledby="chat-settings-title">
<header class="chat-settings-heading"><h2 id="chat-settings-title">Session settings</h2><button id="chat-settings-close" type="button" aria-label="Close settings" hidden>Close</button></header>
<div class="chat-setting"><label for="chat-model">Model</label>
<select id="chat-model"<% if #models == 0 then %> disabled<% end %>>
<% if #models == 0 then %><option value="">None available</option><% else %>
<% for _, model in ipairs(models) do %><option value="<%= model %>"><%= model %></option><% end %>
<% end %>
</select>
<% if #models == 0 then %><p class="muted">Ask your operator to grant you a model on a GLM or compatible channel.</p><% end %>
</div>
<div class="chat-setting"><label for="chat-reasoning">Reasoning</label><select id="chat-reasoning"><option value="default">Provider default</option><option value="enabled">Enabled</option><option value="disabled">Disabled</option></select><p id="chat-reasoning-hint" class="muted"></p></div>
<div class="chat-setting" role="group" aria-labelledby="chat-sampling-title" aria-describedby="chat-sampling-hint">
<h3 id="chat-sampling-title">Sampling</h3>
<p id="chat-sampling-hint" class="muted">Leave fields blank to use provider defaults. Support and limits may vary by model.</p>
<div class="chat-sampling-fields">
<label>Temperature<input id="chat-temperature" type="number" min="0" max="2" step="any" placeholder="Default"></label>
<label>Top P<input id="chat-top_p" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="any" placeholder="Default"></label>
<label>Frequency penalty<input id="chat-frequency_penalty" type="number" min="-2" max="2" step="any" placeholder="Default"></label>
<label>Presence penalty<input id="chat-presence_penalty" type="number" min="-2" max="2" step="any" placeholder="Default"></label>
</div>
<details id="chat-sampling-advanced" class="chat-sampling-advanced" hidden open>
<summary>Advanced sampling</summary>
<p class="muted">OpenAI-compatible servers only. Some servers may ignore or reject these settings.</p>
<div class="chat-sampling-fields">
<label>Top K<input id="chat-top_k" type="number" min="-1" step="1" placeholder="Default"></label>
<label>Min P<input id="chat-min_p" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="any" placeholder="Default"></label>
<label>Repeat penalty<input id="chat-repeat_penalty" type="number" min="0" step="any" placeholder="Default"></label>
<label>Seed<input id="chat-seed" type="number" step="1" placeholder="Default"></label>
</div>
</details>
</div>
<div class="chat-setting"><label for="chat-system">System prompt</label><textarea id="chat-system" rows="4" maxlength="100000" placeholder="Instructions sent before the conversation"></textarea><p class="muted">Changes apply to subsequent requests. New chat keeps these settings.</p></div>
<div class="chat-setting"><label class="chat-tool-toggle"><span>JavaScript tools</span><input id="chat-tools" type="checkbox"></label><p class="muted">Off after every reload. Outputs are sent back to the model.</p><details class="chat-tool-help"><summary>Sandbox &amp; execution limits</summary><p>JavaScript runs in an isolated worker: no page DOM, credentials, storage, or network. Five seconds per call, four calls per step, six inference requests per turn. There is no browser memory quota; only enable it for sessions you trust.</p></details></div>
</aside>
</div>
<dialog id="chat-settings-dialog" class="chat-settings-dialog" aria-labelledby="chat-settings-title"></dialog>
